  <!-- Page Header -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>THE MAKING OF JALEN HURTS</h1>
      <p>
        From his early days in college football to becoming
        the face of the Philadelphia Eagles, Jalen Hurts'
        journey is defined by growth, determination and
        his ability to impact the game in multiple ways.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        By Kai Mathis
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main class="container my-5">

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <section class="mb-5">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        A Quarterback's Evolution
      </h2>
      <p>
        Jalen Hurts entered the NFL in 2020 after playing
        college football at Alabama and Oklahoma. Since
        joining the Philadelphia Eagles, he has developed
        into one of the league's most recognizable
        dual-threat quarterbacks.
      </p>
      <p>
        The following visualizations examine his passing
        production, touchdown statistics and the journey
        that brought him to Philadelphia.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Graphic 1 -->
    <section class="graphic-section">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Jalen Hurts' Passing Yards by Season
      </h2>

      <p class="chatter">
        Hurts' passing production increased significantly
        during his early NFL career, reaching a career
        high of 3,858 passing yards in 2023.
      </p>

      <iframe
        title="Jalen Hurts Passing Yards"
        aria-label="Data visualization of Jalen Hurts passing yards"
        src="https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/3Kav5/1/"
        scrolling="no"
        frameborder="0"
        style="width:100%;border:none;"
        height="500">
      </iframe>

      <p class="source">
        Source:
        <a href="https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/H/HurtJa00.htm"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Pro Football Reference
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Graphic 2 -->
    <section class="graphic-section">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        The Dual-Threat Quarterback
      </h2>

      <p class="chatter">
        Hurts' ability to score through the air and on
        the ground has made him a key part of the Eagles'
        offense. His rushing touchdowns highlight the
        additional threat he brings near the goal line.
      </p>

      <iframe
        title="Jalen Hurts Passing and Rushing Touchdowns"
        aria-label="Comparison of passing and rushing touchdowns"
        src="https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/tj2js/1/"
        scrolling="no"
        frameborder="0"
        style="width:100%;border:none;"
        height="500">
      </iframe>

      <p class="source">
        Source:
        <a href="https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/H/HurtJa00.htm"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Pro Football Reference
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Graphic 3 -->
    <section class="graphic-section">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        From Texas to Philadelphia
      </h2>

      <p class="chatter">
        Jalen Hurts' football journey began in Channelview,
        Texas, before taking him to the University of Alabama,
        the University of Oklahoma and eventually the
        Philadelphia Eagles. Each stop helped shape his
        development as a quarterback.
      </p>

      <iframe
        title="Jalen Hurts Football Journey Map"
        aria-label="Map of Jalen Hurts football career locations"
        src="https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/sfQ0A/2/"
        scrolling="no"
        frameborder="0"
        style="width:100%;border:none;"
        height="600">
      </iframe>

      <p class="source">
        Source:
        <a href="https://www.philadelphiaeagles.com/team/players-roster/jalen-hurts/"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Philadelphia Eagles
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <section class="mb-5">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        More Than Just the Numbers
      </h2>

      <p>
        Jalen Hurts' career illustrates how a quarterback
        can develop through different systems and
        opportunities. His production as both a passer
        and runner demonstrates the versatility that
        has become central to his success in Philadelphia.
      </p>
